hadiths[41]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1288","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Urwah se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se ke unhon ne farmaya: Hafsah bint Abdur Rahman muntaqil ho gayin jab woh teesri haiz ke khoon mein dakhil huin. Ibn Shihab ne farmaya: Phir main ne yeh baat Amrah bint Abdur Rahman se zikr ki, to unhon ne farmaya: Urwah ne sach kaha. Aur logon ne un se is bare mein jhagda kiya tha, aur kaha: Allah farmata hai: teen quru (Al-Baqarah: 228). To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Tum ne sach kaha, aur kya tum jante ho aqra kya hain? Aqra pakizgi ke din hain."
"1289","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman ko kehte suna: Main ne apne fuqaha mein se kisi ko nahin paya magar woh yahi kehta tha, yani jo Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya."
"1290","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Amrah se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab mutallaqah aurat teesri haiz ke khoon mein dakhil ho jaye to woh us se bari ho gayi."
"1291","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' aur Zaid bin Aslam se: Sulaiman bin Yasar ke bare mein ke Ahwas Shaam mein fout hua jab us ki biwi teesri haiz ke khoon mein dakhil hui thi. Aur us ne use talaq de di thi, to Muawiyah ne Zaid bin Sabit ko khat likh kar us bare mein poocha, to Zaid ne unhein likha: Jab woh teesri haiz ke khoon mein dakhil ho jaye to woh us se bari ho gayi aur woh us se bari ho gaya, na woh us ki waris hogi aur na woh us ka waris hoga."
"1292","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Sulaiman bin Yasar ne Zaid bin Sabit se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: Jab mutallaqah teesri haiz mein dakhil ho jaye to woh us se bari ho gayi."
"1293","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko talaq de aur woh teesri haiz ke khoon mein dakhil ho jaye to woh us se bari ho gayi aur woh us se bara ho gaya, na woh us ki waris hogi aur na woh us ka waris hoga. Yeh chhe hadeesein Kitab Idad se nikali."
"1294","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman maula Aal Talhah se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Abdullah bin Utbah se, Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se ke unhon ne farmaya: Ghulam do aurton se nikah karega aur do talaqen dega, aur laundi ki iddat do haiz hogi, agar use haiz na aata ho to do mah ya dedh mah. Sufyan ne farmaya: Woh siqah the."
"1295","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Amr bin Aus Saqafi se, Saqeef ke ek aadmi se: Us ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Agar main taqat rakhta to use dedh haiz bana deta, to ek aadmi ne kaha: Use dedh mah bana den. To Umar khamosh rahe."
"1296","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Unhon ne Ummul Walad ke bare mein jise us ka aaqa fout ho jaye, farmaya: Woh ek haiz iddat guzaregi. Yeh teenon hadeesein Kitab Idad se nikali."
"1297","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id aur Yazid bin Abdullah bin Qusait se, Ibn Musayyab se ke unhon ne farmaya, Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu): Jo aurat talaq di jaye aur woh ek ya do haiz dekhe, phir us ka haiz ruk jaye to woh nau mah intezar karegi, agar hamal zahir ho jaye to wahi, warna nau mah ke baad teen mah iddat guzaregi phir halal ho jayegi. Kitab Idad se nikali."
"1298","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ibn Musayyab aur Sulaiman bin Yasar se: Tulaikha Rushaid Saqafi ke nikah mein thi, to us ne use qat'i talaq de di, phir us ne apni iddat mein nikah kar liya. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne use mara aur us ke shohar ko kode se chand zarben lagayin, aur un ke darmiyan tafreeq kar di, phir Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Jo aurat apni iddat mein nikah kare, agar us ka shohar jis ne us se nikah kiya hai us se suhbat na ki ho, to un ke darmiyan tafreeq ki jayegi, phir woh apne pehle shohar se apni baqi iddat guzaregi, aur woh khatb karne walon mein se ek khatib hoga, aur agar us ne us se suhbat ki ho to un ke darmiyan tafreeq ki jayegi phir woh pehle se apni baqi iddat guzaregi, phir doosre se iddat guzaregi phir woh us se kabhi nikah nahin karega. Sa'id ne farmaya: Aur us ke liye us ka meher hai jo us ne us se halal kiya."
"1299","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Hassan ne hamein khabar di, Jareer se, Ata bin Sa'ib se, Zazan Abu Umar se, Ali se: Unhon ne us aurat ke bare mein jo apni iddat mein shadi kare faisla farmaya ke un ke darmiyan tafreeq ki jayegi, aur us ke liye sadaq hai jo us ne us ki sharmgah se halal kiya, aur woh apni bigadi hui iddat poori karegi, aur doosre se iddat guzaregi. Dono hadeesein Kitab Idad se nikali."
"1300","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, apne walid se: Subai'ah bint Haris ne apne shohar ki wafat ke chand raaton baad waza hamal kiya, phir Abu Sanabil bin Ba'kak un ke paas se guzre, to bole: Tum ne shoharon ke liye banao singhar kiya hai, iddat chaar mah das din hai, to Subai'ah ne yeh baat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zikr ki to Aap ne farmaya: Abu Sanabil ne jhoot kaha, ya Abu Sanabil ne jaisa kaha waisa nahin, tum halal ho gayi ho, nikah kar lo."
"1301","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abd Rabbihi bin Sa'id bin Qais se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Abbas aur Abu Hurairah se us hamila ke bare mein poocha gaya jise us ka shohar fout ho jaye, to Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Dono muddaton mein se aakhri, aur Abu Hurairah ne farmaya: Jab woh janam de de to halal ho gayi. Phir Abu Salamah Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salamah ke paas gaye aur un se is bare mein poocha, to unhon ne farmaya: Subai'ah Aslamiyah ne apne shohar ki wafat ke aadhe mah baad janam diya. Phir use do mardon ne paigham bheja: ek jawan, aur doosra adhed, to use jawan ki taraf paigham diya gaya, to adhed ne kaha: Woh halal nahin hui. Aur us ke ghar wale ghaib the, aur use ummeed thi ke jab us ke ghar wale aayenge to use us par tarjeeh denge, to woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi, to Aap ne farmaya: Tum halal ho gayi ho, jis se chaho nikah kar lo."
"1302","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se: Ibn Abbas aur Abu Salamah ne us aurat ke bare mein ikhtilaf kiya jo apne shohar ki wafat ke chand raaton baad nafas wali ho, to Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Dono muddaton mein se aakhri, aur Abu Salamah ne farmaya: Jab woh nafas wali ho jaye to halal ho gayi. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir Abu Hurairah aaye, to bole: Main apne bhatije ke sath hun, yani Abu Salamah, phir unhon ne Kuraib maula Ibn Abbas ko Umm Salamah ki taraf bheja, to us ne un se is bare mein poocha, phir woh un ke paas aaya aur unhein khabar di ke unhon ne farmaya: Subai'ah Aslamiyah ne apne shohar ki wafat ke chand raaton baad janam diya, phir us ne yeh baat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zikr ki to Aap ne un se farmaya: Tum halal ho gayi ho, nikah kar lo."
"1303","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Miswar bin Makhramah se: Subai'ah Aslamiyah ne apne shohar ki wafat ke chand raaton baad nafas paya, phir woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur Aap se nikah ki ijazat mangi to Aap ne use ijazat de di."
"1304","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Un se us aurat ke bare mein poocha gaya jise us ka shohar fout ho jaye aur woh hamila ho, to Ibn Umar ne farmaya: Jab woh apna hamal waza kar de to halal ho gayi. Phir Ansar mein se ek aadmi ne unhein khabar di: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Agar woh janam de de aur us ka shohar abhi bistar par ho aur dafan na hua ho to woh halal ho gayi. Pehli Kitab Risalah se, aur paanchwin ke aakhir tak Kitab Idad se nikali."
"1305","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sa'id bin Salim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne use khabar di, ke Ansar mein se ek aadmi, jise Habban bin Munqiz kaha jata hai, ne apni biwi ko talaq di jab woh tandrust tha, aur woh us ki beti ko doodh pila rahi thi, phir satrah mah guzar gaye aur use haiz na aaya, doodh use haiz se rokta raha, phir Habban use talaq dene ke saat ya aath mah baad beemar hua, to main ne us se kaha: Tumhari biwi tumhari waris banna chahti hai. To us ne apne ghar walon se kaha: Mujhe Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas le chalo, to woh use un ke paas le gaye, phir us ne unhein apni biwi ka mamla bataya aur un ke paas Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) aur Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) the, to Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un dono se farmaya: Tum dono kya samajhte ho? To dono ne kaha: Hum samajhte hain ke woh us ki waris hogi agar woh mare, aur woh us ka waris hoga agar woh mare, kyunke woh un budhi aurton mein se nahin jo haiz se mayoos ho gayi hain, aur na un kunwariyon mein se hai jo haiz ki umr ko nahin pahunchin, phir woh apne haiz ki iddat par hai chahe thoda ho ya zyada, phir Habban apne ghar walon ki taraf laut aaya aur apni beti le li, phir jab doodh chhoot gaya to use ek haiz aaya phir doosra haiz aaya phir Habban teesri haiz se pehle fout ho gaya, to us ne miyyat wali ki iddat guzari aur us ki waris bani. Unhon ne farmaya: Habban bin Munqiz ke bare mein ek kitab mein ba ke sath hai."
"1306","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Yahya bin Habban se: Woh apne dada ke paas theen aur un ke nikah mein ek Hashmiyah aur ek Ansariyah thin, to us ne Ansariyah ko talaq di jab woh doodh pila rahi thi, phir ek saal guzar gaya, phir woh fout ho gaya aur use haiz na aaya. To us ne kaha: Main us ki waris hun, mujhe haiz nahin aaya, to woh Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas jhagde, to unhon ne Ansariyah ke haq mein virasat ka faisla farmaya, to Hashmiyah ne Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ko malamat ki, to unhon ne farmaya: Yeh tumhare chachazad ka kaam hai, usi ne hamein is ka mashwara diya tha, yani Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu). Dono hadeesein Kitab Idad se nikali."
"1307","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne apni kitab mein farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ata bin Sa'ib se, Abd Khair se, Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, us aadmi ke bare mein jo aurat se nikah kare phir mar jaye aur us se suhbat na ki ho aur us ke liye sadaq muqarrar na kiya ho ke us ke liye virasat hai aur us par iddat hai aur us ke liye sadaq nahin."
"1308","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se: Ubaidullah bin Umar ki beti aur us ki maan Zaid bin Khattab ki beti, Abdullah bin Umar ke bete ke nikah mein thi, phir woh fout ho gaya aur us ne us se suhbat na ki thi aur us ke liye sadaq muqarrar na kiya tha, to us ki maan ne us ka sadaq manga, to Ibn Umar ne farmaya: Us ke liye sadaq nahin, aur agar us ke liye sadaq hota to hum tumhein na rokte aur na us par zulm karte, to us ne use qubool karne se inkar kiya, phir un ke darmiyan Zaid bin Sabit ko hakam banaya, to unhon ne faisla farmaya ke us ke liye sadaq nahin aur us ke liye virasat hai. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaf Ali wa Abdillah mein se, us mein se jo Rabi' ne Shafi'i se nahin suna, aur doosri Kitab Sadaq wal Ila se nikali."
"1309","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm se, Humaid bin Nafi' se, Zainab bint Abi Salamah se ke unhon ne use yeh teenon hadeesein khabar din. Unhon ne farmaya: Zainab ne farmaya: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Habibah ke paas gayi jab Abu Sufyan fout hue. To Umm Habibah ne khushbu mangayi jis mein khalooq ya us ke siva ki zardi thi, phir laundi ne us mein se lagaya phir unhon ne apne rukhsaron par mala, phir farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Mujhe khushbu ki koi hajat nahin siwae is ke ke main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti hai halal nahin ke woh kisi miyyat par teen raaton se zyada sog manaye, magar shohar par chaar mah das din."
"1310","[AI-translation] Aur Zainab ne farmaya: Main Zainab bint Jahsh ke paas gayi jab un ke bhai fout hue, to unhon ne khushbu mangayi aur us mein se lagayi phir farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Mujhe khushbu ki koi hajat nahin siwae is ke ke main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mimbar par farmate suna: Kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti hai halal nahin ke woh kisi miyyat par teen raaton se zyada sog manaye magar shohar par chaar mah das din."
"1311","[AI-translation] Aur Zainab ne farmaya: Main ne apni walida Umm Salamah ko kehte suna: Ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur boli: Aye Allah ke Rasool, meri beti ko us ka shohar fout ho gaya hai, aur us ki aankh mein takleef hai, kya hum use surma lagayen? To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nahin, do ya teen baar. Har baar farmate: Nahin, phir farmaya: Woh sirf chaar mah das din hai. Aur tum mein se ek jahiliyat mein saal poora hone par gobar phenkti thi. Zainab ne farmaya: Aurat jab use us ka shohar fout ho jata, woh hifsh mein dakhil hoti, aur apne badtareen kapde pehenti, aur khushbu aur kuch na lagati yahan tak ke us par saal guzar jata, phir sawari ya gadha ya bakri ya parinda laya jata aur woh use pakadti, to kam hi hota ke woh kisi cheez ko pakadti magar woh mar jata, phir woh nikalti, to use gobar diya jata aur woh use phenk deti, phir us ke baad jo khushbu ya us ke siva chahti istemal karti. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Hifsh chhota zaleel ghar hai baal aur imarat aur us ke siva se. Aur qabs janwar se koi jagah ungliyon ke siron se pakadna hai. Aur qabz poore hatheli se pakadna hai."
"1312","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Safiyyah bint Abi Ubaid se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) aur Hafsah, ya Aishah ya Hafsah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti hai halal nahin ke woh kisi miyyat par teen raaton se zyada sog manaye magar shohar par chaar mah das din. Yeh chaaron hadeesein Kitab Idad se nikali."
"1313","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Yahya bin Hassan ne hamein khabar di, Abu Awanah se, Mansoor bin Mu'tamir se, Minhal bin Amr se, Abbad bin Abdullah Asadi se, Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Unhon ne mafqood ki biwi ke bare mein farmaya: Woh nikah nahin karegi."
"1314","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Hassan ne hamein khabar di, Hushaim bin Bashir se, Sayyar Abul Hakam se, Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, mafqood ki biwi ke bare mein jab woh aa jaye, aur us ki biwi ne nikah kar liya ho: Agar woh chahe to talaq de, aur agar chahe to rakhe, aur aurat ko ikhtiyar nahin diya jayega. Dono hadeesein Kitab Idad se nikali."
"1315","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Yazid maula Aswad bin Sufyan se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, Fatimah bint Qais se: Abu Amr bin Hafs ne use qat'i talaq di jab woh Shaam mein ghaib tha, phir hadees zikr ki, aur us mein farmaya: Phir woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur Aap se yeh zikr kiya to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare liye us par nafaqah nahin, aur use hukm diya ke woh Umm Sharik ke ghar mein iddat guzare, phir farmaya: Woh aisi aurat hai jise mere ashab aate hain, pas Ibn Umm Maktoom ke paas iddat guzaro, kyunke woh andha aadmi hai, tum apne kapde utar sakogi."
"1316","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Abi Yahya ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Maimoon bin Mihran se, apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Madinah aaya aur wahan walon mein se sab se aalim ke bare mein poocha, to mujhe Sa'id bin Musayyab tak pahunchaya gaya, to main ne un se mabtootah ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne farmaya: Woh apne shohar ke ghar mein iddat guzaregi. To main ne kaha: Phir Fatimah bint Qais ki hadees kahan hai? To unhon ne farmaya: Haanh, aur bayan kiya ke woh gussa hue, aur farmaya: Fatimah ne logon ko halaak kiya aur us ki zaban mein tezi thi aur woh apne susraliyon par chha gayi, to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use hukm diya ke woh Umm Maktoom ke ghar mein iddat guzare."
"1317","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Qasim aur Sulaiman se: Unhon ne un dono ko zikr karte suna: Yahya bin Sa'id bin Aas ne Abdur Rahman bin Hakam ki beti ko qat'i talaq di, to Abdur Rahman bin Hakam use le aaya, to Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne Marwan bin Hakam jo Madinah ke ameer the, ki taraf paigham bheja, aur farmaya: Aye Marwan, Allah se daro, aur aurat ko us ke ghar wapas karo. To Marwan ne Sulaiman ki hadees mein farmaya: Abdur Rahman mujh par ghalib aa gaya. Aur Marwan ne Qasim ki hadees mein farmaya: Kya tumhein Fatimah bint Qais ka mamla nahin pahuncha? To unhon ne farmaya: Tum par Fatimah ke mamle ka zikr na karne ka koi harj nahin. To us ne kaha: Agar tumhein sirf shar hai to tumhare liye in dono ke darmiyan ke shar mein se kafi shar hai."
"1318","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Amr se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim se: Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) farmaya karti thin: Aye Fatimah, Allah se daro, tum jaan chuki ho yeh kis bare mein tha."
"1319","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad Darawardi ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Amr se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Allah Ta'ala ke farman ke bare mein: Magar yeh ke woh khuli behayai karen (At-Talaq: 1). Unhon ne farmaya: Ke woh apne shohar ke ghar walon par zahir ho jaye, phir jab woh zahir ho jaye to use nikalna halal ho gaya. Yeh chaaron hadeesein Kitab Idad se, aur paanchwin Kitab Ahkamul Quran se nikali."
"1320","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Yazid maula Aswad bin Sufyan se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, Fatimah bint Qais se: Abu Amr bin Hafs ne use qat'i talaq di jab woh Shaam mein ghaib tha. To us ne us ki taraf apne wakeel ko jau de kar bheja aur woh use napasand hua, to us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tumhare liye hum par kuch nahin, phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur Aap se yeh zikr kiya to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare liye us par nafaqah nahin."
"1321","[AI-translation] Abdul Majeed ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Abu Zubair se, Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Unhon ne use kehte suna: Mutallaqah ka nafaqah hai jab tak woh haram na ho jaye, phir jab woh haram ho jaye to maroof ke sath mata' hai."
"1322","[AI-translation] Abdul Majeed ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne farmaya: Ata ne farmaya: Us se mabtootah hamila kisi cheez mein nahin magar yeh ke woh hamal ki wajah se us par kharch kare, phir agar woh hamila na ho to us ke liye nafaqah nahin. Pehli Kitab Ahkamul Quran se aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Idad se nikali."
"1323","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Sa'd bin Ishaq bin Ka'b bin Ujrah se, apni phuphi Zainab bint Ka'b se: Furai'ah bint Malik bin Sinan ne unhein khabar di: Woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur Aap se apne ghar walon ki taraf Bani Khudrah mein laut jane ki ijazat mangi, kyunke us ka shohar apne bhagode ghulamon ki talash mein nikla tha yahan tak ke jab woh taraf Qudum mein tha to woh use mile aur use qatl kar diya. To us ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se manga ke main apne ghar walon ki taraf laut jaun kyunke mere shohar ne mujhe kisi makan mein nahin chhoda jise woh malik tha, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Han, phir main wapas gayi yahan tak ke jab main hujre ya masjid mein thi, Aap ne mujhe bulaya ya mere bare mein hukm diya aur mujhe bulaya gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne kya kaha tha? To main ne Aap ko woh qissa dohraya jo main ne Aap ko apne shohar ke mamle mein bataya tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Apne ghar mein thehro yahan tak ke kitab apni muddat ko pahunch jaye. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir main ne us mein chaar mah das din iddat guzari, phir jab Usman the, unhon ne meri taraf bheja aur mujh se is bare mein poocha, to main ne unhein khabar di aur unhon ne is ki pairwi ki aur is se faisla farmaya."
"1324","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, unhon ne dehati aurat ke bare mein jise us ka shohar fout ho jaye, farmaya: Woh wahin rahegi jahan us ke ghar wale rahen."
"1325","[AI-translation] Abdul Majeed ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Hisham se, apne walid se aur Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se usi ki tarah ya usi mani ki tarah; us ki mukhalifat nahin karte."
"1326","[AI-translation] Abdul Majeed ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Abu Zubair se, Jabir se: Unhon ne farmaya: Us aurat ke liye jise us ka shohar fout ho jaye nafaqah nahin, us ke liye virasat kafi hai. Pehli Kitab Risalah se, aur chauthi ke aakhir tak Kitab Idad se nikali."
"1327","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdul Majeed ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ibn Shihab se, Salim bin Abdullah se, Ubaidullah se: Woh farmaya karte the: Aurat ke liye durust nahin ke woh ek raat bhi guzare jab woh wafat ya talaq ki iddat mein ho magar apne ghar mein."
"1328","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se: Sa'id bin Zaid ki beti Abdullah ke nikah mein thin, to us ne use qat'i talaq di, to woh nikal gayi, to Ibn Umar ne use is par napasand farmaya. Dono hadeesein Kitab Idad se nikali."
